IMPORT `rta-renting`

-- Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA), with the Residential Tenancies Regulations 1989 (WA), ss 5, 26B, 27, 27B, 27C, 28-31B, 60-70A, 76C, 80, 81C-81K, 99; regs 10A, 10AD, 10ABA, 11, 11A, 5CB -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (the Residential Tenancies Regulations 1989 are used as deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_residential-tenancies-act_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake}/facts.json: c050, Chloe and Liam rent a
-- unit in Cannington from 1 September 2027 at $480 a week; k057, Jake and Tahlia rent a one-bedroom unit in Gosnells
-- from 1 November 2033 at $420 a week. The lives do not state a fixed term, a property manager, a pet, or the dates of
-- any notice: a 12-month term to 31 August 2028, a property manager, Jake's cat and every notice date are HYPOTHETICAL.
-- Chloe and Liam move to their Byford house in July 2029 (c050's sequel in the scenario); the notice they give is dated
-- hypothetically.

