#ASSERT `What does my lessor's notice do` `I breached a term other than paying rent, and have not remedied it` `a notice given 15 May 2029 for 22 May 2029, after a notice to remedy on 1 May` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `valid: if I have not left by the day it names, my lessor must apply to a court`
#ASSERT `What does my lessor's notice do` `I breached a term other than paying rent, and have not remedied it` `a notice given 15 May 2029 for 22 May 2029, after a notice to remedy on 5 May` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `ineffectual: no notice to remedy was given at least 14 days before`
#ASSERT `What does my lessor's notice do` `I have not paid rent` `a notice given 15 May 2029 for 22 May 2029, with no notice to remedy` `Chloe's periodic tenancy in 2029` EQUALS `valid as an immediate rent notice: if I pay all rent owing before the day it names, my lessor may not apply to a court`
#ASSERT `What does my lessor's notice do` `no ground` `a notice given 1 June 2029 for 31 July 2029` `the same, with the court's authorisation` EQUALS `ineffectual: excessive-rent proceedings or an order (section 65)`

#ASSERT `By when must I apply to extend a no-grounds notice` (Date 1 6 2029) EQUALS (Date 8 6 2029)

§ `ss 67-70A, 76C -- c050's sequel: Chloe and Liam end their tenancy to move to Byford`

#ASSERT NOT `May I end my tenancy by notice on this ground` `without a ground` TRUE
#ASSERT `May I end my tenancy by notice on this ground` `the premises have become unusable or been acquired` TRUE

#ASSERT `How many days notice must I give` `without a ground` EQUALS 21

#ASSERT `Is my notice to end the tenancy valid` `without a ground` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 7 2029) (Date 22 7 2029) (Date 31 8 2028)
#ASSERT NOT `Is my notice to end the tenancy valid` `without a ground` FALSE TRUE (Date 1 7 2029) (Date 21 7 2029) (Date 31 8 2028)
#ASSERT `Is my notice to end the tenancy valid` `to end my fixed term` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 8 2028) (Date 31 8 2028) (Date 31 8 2028)

#ASSERT `the last day to give notice ending my term on its expiry day` (Date 31 8 2028) EQUALS (Date 1 8 2028)

#ASSERT `What happens when my fixed term expires` FALSE (Date 31 8 2028) (Date 31 8 2028) EQUALS `it continues as a periodic tenancy on the same terms`

§ `ss 81C-81K -- getting the bond back`

#ASSERT `May I be asked to sign a bond release application` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `May I be asked to sign a bond release application` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Is my lessor entitled to this from my bond` `fair wear and tear` FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my lessor entitled to this from my bond` `cleaning what I did not leave reasonably clean` FALSE

#ASSERT `What happens to my bond application` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the bond administrator must pay the bond as the application states`
#ASSERT `What happens to my bond application` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `it goes to the Commissioner to decide`

